{
  "id": "note-from-the-author",
  "kind": "introduction",
  "sourceKind": "author-note",
  "label": "Note from the Author",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "sourceRange": [
    59,
    86
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 59
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The Human Fiction is not written to convince, convert, or correct."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is written to observe."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 61
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "What it observes is not the world in an external sense…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 62
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but the way experience is internally structured through thought, memory, and interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 63
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Most of what we call “understanding” is actually narration happening in real time."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A continuous attempt to make experience coherent."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 65
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book does not oppose meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 66
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It only points to how meaning is constantly being generated."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 67
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Silently."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 68
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Automatically."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Without permission."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 70
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you read carefully, you may notice something subtle:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that what feels like a fixed “self” is actually a moving interpretation…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "held together by memory, language, and expectation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing in these pages demands belief."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And nothing requires rejection."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because belief and rejection both belong to the same system — interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This work is not about reaching a conclusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is about noticing the process through which conclusions are formed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And once that process is seen clearly…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "its authority begins to soften."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not through effort."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But through understanding itself."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The Human Fiction does not end with an answer."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 83
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It ends with a shift in seeing:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that experience does not need to be explained in order to be real."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It only needs to be seen."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    }
  ],
  "index": 5,
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
  "file": "chapters/05-note-from-the-author.json"
}
